WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.875
To sum up.

2
00:00:00.875 --> 00:00:05.110
You packaged the client with Learn's
values, checked it on a pilot device,

3
00:00:05.110 --> 00:00:09.705
counted the devices the service sees,
enabled the Microsoft traffic profile

4
00:00:09.705 --> 00:00:13.725
for the pilot, turned on signaling,
and proved source I P restoration.

5
00:00:13.725 --> 00:00:16.504
The evidence an I S S O
keeps from this module:

6
00:00:16.504 --> 00:00:19.977
the Intune app's assignment
export and detection rule,

7
00:00:19.977 --> 00:00:25.149
the client health check export, the device
usage summary with the coverage ratio,

8
00:00:25.149 --> 00:00:28.854
the profile export and its
assignments, the signaling GET,

9
00:00:28.854 --> 00:00:31.787
the source I P comparison,
and the sign-in share.

10
00:00:31.787 --> 00:00:36.078
Next is Module 3, the compliant
network and tenant restrictions,

11
00:00:36.078 --> 00:00:39.801
the two signals only Entra
can produce from the network,

12
00:00:39.801 --> 00:00:43.420
run in report-only or a pilot
before they block anyone.
